KZ3 patch 2189 (RSX pass 167, command-thread overhaul O1): legacy rsx_state machine off the FIFO walker under live draw, GCM_FAST_METHODS default on.

GCM_LEGACY_STATE_SKIP: unset/1 = skip (default; before: off), 0 = off, verify = the machine runs for every method (shadow) and the
backend callbacks it makes after a method outside the effect list are counted per method ([legacy-skip] line, READER line).
Skip applies when live draw is up and the backend is none or the null backend. Effect list (rsx_legacy_skip.h, reasons there):
0x50, 0x104, 0x180, 0x1A4, 0x1D6C, 0x1D70, 0x1D74 + 0x1A8, SET_OBJECT, 0xE920/E924. GCM_FAST_METHODS now defaults to 1 (0 = off).
Host test tools/smoke/test_legacy_skip.sh (core, static checks, replay skip/off/verify identical, negative control, play-through capture).

